Exception: pixel art and characters (그림·캐릭터 예외)

The MIT License above covers the source code only. It does NOT cover the
pixel art and characters (house backgrounds, furniture, the cat "Dubu",
avatars, outfits, app icon) contained in the following files and folders:

  - js/assets_rooms.js   (pixel art data for the houses and furniture)
  - js/house_rooms.js    (house layouts and palettes)
  - js/outfit_public.js  (avatar and outfit pixel art)
  - js/placeholders.js   (the pixel maps of the cat "Dubu"; PH_TEMP_SPRITES)
  - img/                 (screenshots)
  - icons/               (app icon)

